<title>CHINA: Uniworld year net jumps to HK$54 mln.</title>
<headline>Uniworld year net jumps to HK$54 mln.</headline>
<dateline>HONG KONG 1997-08-04</dateline>
<text>
<p>Year ended March 31</p>
<p>(in million HK$ unless stated)</p>
<p>    Shr (H.K. cents)	   0.27	 vs 0.01</p>
<p>    Dividend (H.K. cents)    nil	  vs nil</p>
<p>    Exceptional items	  31.46 gain vs 25.02 loss</p>
<p>    Net			    54.34	vs 1.97</p>
<p>    Turnover		     677.01     vs 497.51</p>
<p>    Company name		 Uniworld Holdings Ltd</p>
<p>    Books close		  N/A</p>
<p>    Dividend payable	   N/A</p>
<p>NOTE - Investment holding firm Uniworld Holdings has subsidiaries in Chinese medicine retailing, health food and manufacturing of domestic utensils.</p>
<p>Exceptional gain represents profit on sales of an interest in a subsidiary.</p>
<p>-- Hong Kong News Room (852) 2843 6368</p>
